This is a complete HTML document that implements the 2048 puzzle game with a dark theme, arrow-key controls, score tracking, and a programmatic API for automated testing.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>2048</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #1a1a2e;
            --board-bg: #16213e;
            --cell-empty: #252547;
            --cell-2: #eee4da;
            --cell-4: #ede0c8;
            --cell-8: #f2b179;
            --cell-16: #f59563;
            --cell-32: #f67c5f;
            --cell-64: #f65e3b;
            --cell-128: #edcf72;
            --cell-256: #edcc61;
            --cell-512: #edc850;
            --cell-1024: #edc53f;
            --cell-2048: #edc22e;
            --cell-4096: #5e4caf;
            --cell-8192: #3c3a8f;
            --cell-super: #1c1a5e;
            --text-dark: #776e65;
            --text-light: #f9f6f2;
            --text-super: #f9f6f2;
            --radius: 8px;
            --cell-radius: 6px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #0f0f1a;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -moz-user-select: none;
        }

        .game-container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #edc22e;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(237, 194, 46, 0.4);
        }

        .score-wrapper {
            background: #16213e;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 12px 22px;
            min-width: 100px;
        }

        .score-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #8899bb;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        #score {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #f9f6f2;
        }

        #reset {
            background: #edc22e;
            color: #1a1a2e;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 26px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(237, 194, 46, 0.3);
        }

        #reset:hover {
            background: #f0d04a;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(237, 194, 46, 0.5);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        #reset:active {
            transform: scale(0.96);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(237, 194, 46, 0.4);
        }

        .board-wrapper {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #16213e;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        #board {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            width: 380px;
            height: 380px;
        }

        .cell {
            background: #252547;
            border-radius: var(--cell-radius);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all 0.12s ease;
            position: relative;
            min-width: 0;
            min-height: 0;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
        }

        .cell[data-value="0"] {
            background: #1e1e3a;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .cell[data-value="2"] {
            background: #eee4da;
            color: #776e65;
        }
        .cell[data-value="4"] {
            background: #ede0c8;
            color: #776e65;
        }
        .cell[data-value="8"] {
            background: #f2b179;
            color: #f9f6f2;
        }
        .cell[data-value="16"] {
            background: #f59563;
            color: #f9f6f2;
        }
        .cell[data-value="32"] {
            background: #f67c5f;
            color: #f9f6f2;
        }
        .cell[data-value="64"] {
            background: #f65e3b;
            color: #f9f6f2;
        }
        .cell[data-value="128"] {
            background: #edcf72;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
        }
        .cell[data-value="256"] {
            background: #edcc61;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
        }
        .cell[data-value="512"] {
            background: #edc850;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
        }
        .cell[data-value="1024"] {
            background: #edc53f;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        .cell[data-value="2048"] {
            background: #edc22e;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(237, 194, 46, 0.6);
        }
        .cell[data-value="4096"] {
            background: #5e4caf;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(94, 76, 175, 0.6);
        }
        .cell[data-value="8192"] {
            background: #3c3a8f;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(60, 58, 143, 0.6);
        }
        .cell[data-value="16384"],
        .cell[data-value="32768"],
        .cell[data-value="65536"] {
            background: #1c1a5e;
            color: #f9f6f2;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(28, 26, 94, 0.7);
        }

        .cell.pop {
            animation: pop 0.15s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes pop {
            0% {
                transform: scale(0.7);
            }
            60% {
                transform: scale(1.08);
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }

        .game-over-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            z-index: 10;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .game-over-overlay.visible {
            display: flex;
        }

        .game-over-text {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #edc22e;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(237, 194, 46, 0.8);
        }

        @media (max-width: 440px) {
            #board {
                width: 90vw;
                height: 90vw;
                gap: 6px;
            }
            .cell {
                font-size: 1.4rem;
                border-radius: 4px;
            }
            .cell[data-value="128"],
            .cell[data-value="256"],
            .cell[data-value="512"] {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
            .cell[data-value="1024"],
            .cell[data-value="2048"] {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            .cell[data-value="4096"],
            .cell[data-value="8192"] {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            .title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            .header {
                gap: 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="game-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title">2048</div>
            <div class="score-wrapper">
                <div class="score-label">Score</div>
                <div id="score">0</div>
            </div>
            <button id="reset">New Game</button>
        </div>
        <div class="board-wrapper">
            <div id="board"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="game-over-overlay" id="gameOverOverlay">
        <div class="game-over-text">Game Over</div>
        <button id="resetOverlay" style="background:#edc22e;color:#1a1a2e;border:none;padding:12px 26px;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;border-radius:30px;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;">Try Again</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        (function() {
            // ──────────────────── Internal State ────────────────────
            const SIZE = 4;
            let board = createEmptyBoard();
            let currentScore = 0;
            let gameOverFlag = false;

            function createEmptyBoard() {
                const b = [];
                for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                    b[r] = [0, 0, 0, 0];
                }
                return b;
            }

            function deepCopyBoard(b) {
                return b.map(row => [...row]);
            }

            // ──────────────────── DOM Elements ────────────────────
            const boardEl = document.getElementById('board');
            const scoreEl = document.getElementById('score');
            const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');
            const gameOverOverlay = document.getElementById('gameOverOverlay');
            const resetOverlayBtn = document.getElementById('resetOverlay');

            // Create 16 cell elements
            const cellElements = [];
            for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                    const cell = document.createElement('div');
                    cell.className = 'cell';
                    cell.setAttribute('data-row', r);
                    cell.setAttribute('data-col', c);
                    cell.setAttribute('data-value', '0');
                    cell.textContent = '';
                    boardEl.appendChild(cell);
                    cellElements.push(cell);
                }
            }

            // ──────────────────── Rendering ────────────────────
            function render(animateNewCells = false) {
                for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        const idx = r * SIZE + c;
                        const cell = cellElements[idx];
                        const val = board[r][c];
                        const oldVal = parseInt(cell.getAttribute('data-value'), 10);
                        cell.setAttribute('data-value', val);
                        cell.textContent = val === 0 ? '' : val;
                        if (animateNewCells && val !== 0 && oldVal !== val && oldVal === 0) {
                            cell.classList.remove('pop');
                            void cell.offsetWidth;
                            cell.classList.add('pop');
                        } else if (!animateNewCells) {
                            cell.classList.remove('pop');
                        }
                    }
                }
                scoreEl.textContent = currentScore;
            }

            // ──────────────────── Merge Logic ────────────────────
            function slideRowLeft(row) {
                const nonZero = row.filter(v => v !== 0);
                const result = [];
                const mergedFlags = [];
                let scoreGain = 0;

                for (let i = 0; i < nonZero.length; i++) {
                    const val = nonZero[i];
                    const lastIdx = result.length - 1;
                    if (result.length > 0 && result[lastIdx] === val && !mergedFlags[lastIdx]) {
                        result[lastIdx] = val * 2;
                        mergedFlags[lastIdx] = true;
                        scoreGain += val * 2;
                    } else {
                        result.push(val);
                        mergedFlags.push(false);
                    }
                }

                while (result.length < SIZE) {
                    result.push(0);
                }
                return { row: result, scoreGain };
            }

            function transformForDirection(b, direction) {
                const copy = deepCopyBoard(b);
                if (direction === 'left') {
                    return copy;
                }
                if (direction === 'right') {
                    return copy.map(row => [...row].reverse());
                }
                if (direction === 'up') {
                    const transposed = [];
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        transposed[c] = [];
                        for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                            transposed[c][r] = copy[r][c];
                        }
                    }
                    return transposed;
                }
                if (direction === 'down') {
                    const transposed = [];
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        transposed[c] = [];
                        for (let r = SIZE - 1; r >= 0; r--) {
                            transposed[c][SIZE - 1 - r] = copy[r][c];
                        }
                    }
                    return transposed;
                }
                return copy;
            }

            function untransformResult(transformed, originalBoard, direction) {
                if (direction === 'left') {
                    return transformed;
                }
                if (direction === 'right') {
                    return transformed.map(row => [...row].reverse());
                }
                if (direction === 'up') {
                    const result = createEmptyBoard();
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                            result[r][c] = transformed[c][r];
                        }
                    }
                    return result;
                }
                if (direction === 'down') {
                    const result = createEmptyBoard();
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                            result[SIZE - 1 - r][c] = transformed[c][r];
                        }
                    }
                    return result;
                }
                return deepCopyBoard(originalBoard);
            }

            function boardsEqual(a, b) {
                for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        if (a[r][c] !== b[r][c]) return false;
                    }
                }
                return true;
            }

            // ──────────────────── Spawn ────────────────────
            function getEmptyCells(b) {
                const empties = [];
                for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        if (b[r][c] === 0) empties.push({ r, c });
                    }
                }
                return empties;
            }

            function spawnTile(b) {
                const empties = getEmptyCells(b);
                if (empties.length === 0) return false;
                const { r, c } = empties[Math.floor(Math.random() * empties.length)];
                b[r][c] = Math.random() < 0.9 ? 2 : 4;
                return true;
            }

            // ──────────────────── Move ────────────────────
            function move(direction) {
                if (gameOverFlag) return false;
                const transformed = transformForDirection(board, direction);
                let totalScoreGain = 0;
                const newTransformed = [];
                for (let i = 0; i < SIZE; i++) {
                    const { row, scoreGain } = slideRowLeft(transformed[i]);
                    newTransformed.push(row);
                    totalScoreGain += scoreGain;
                }
                const newBoard = untransformResult(newTransformed, board, direction);

                if (boardsEqual(board, newBoard)) {
                    return false;
                }

                board = newBoard;
                currentScore += totalScoreGain;
                spawnTile(board);
                render(true);
                checkGameOver();
                return true;
            }

            function checkGameOver() {
                const empties = getEmptyCells(board);
                if (empties.length > 0) {
                    gameOverFlag = false;
                    gameOverOverlay.classList.remove('visible');
                    return;
                }
                // Check if any adjacent tiles can merge
                for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        const val = board[r][c];
                        if (c + 1 < SIZE && board[r][c + 1] === val) {
                            gameOverFlag = false;
                            gameOverOverlay.classList.remove('visible');
                            return;
                        }
                        if (r + 1 < SIZE && board[r + 1][c] === val) {
                            gameOverFlag = false;
                            gameOverOverlay.classList.remove('visible');
                            return;
                        }
                    }
                }
                gameOverFlag = true;
                gameOverOverlay.classList.add('visible');
            }

            // ──────────────────── Reset ────────────────────
            function reset() {
                board = createEmptyBoard();
                currentScore = 0;
                gameOverFlag = false;
                gameOverOverlay.classList.remove('visible');
                // Spawn exactly 2 tiles
                spawnTile(board);
                spawnTile(board);
                render(false);
            }

            // ──────────────────── setBoard ────────────────────
            function setBoard(arr) {
                if (!Array.isArray(arr) || arr.length !== SIZE) return;
                for (let r = 0; r < SIZE; r++) {
                    if (!Array.isArray(arr[r]) || arr[r].length !== SIZE) return;
                    for (let c = 0; c < SIZE; c++) {
                        const val = arr[r][c];
                        if (typeof val !== 'number' || !Number.isFinite(val) || val < 0) return;
                        board[r][c] = Math.floor(val);
                    }
                }
                gameOverFlag = false;
                gameOverOverlay.classList.remove('visible');
                render(false);
            }

            // ──────────────────── API ────────────────────
            window.game = {
                size: SIZE,
                reset: function() {
                    reset();
                },
                move: function(direction) {
                    const validDirections = ['left', 'right', 'up', 'down'];
                    if (!validDirections.includes(direction)) return false;
                    return move(direction);
                },
                board: function() {
                    return deepCopyBoard(board);
                },
                setBoard: function(arr) {
                    setBoard(arr);
                },
                score: function() {
                    return currentScore;
                }
            };

            // ──────────────────── Event Listeners ────────────────────
            document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
                const keyMap = {
                    'ArrowLeft': 'left',
                    'ArrowRight': 'right',
                    'ArrowUp': 'up',
                    'ArrowDown': 'down'
                };
                const direction = keyMap[e.key];
                if (direction) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    if (!gameOverFlag) {
                        move(direction);
                    }
                }
            });

            resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
                reset();
            });

            resetOverlayBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
                reset();
            });

            // ──────────────────── Initialize ────────────────────
            reset();
            render(false);
        })();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```
### Game Overview

Here’s how the game plays, the layout, controls, and how key features like merging work:

- **Core Loop & Rules:** The game follows classic 2048 rules on a 4x4 grid. You slide tiles to merge equal numbers, doubling their value and adding to your score. Each tile can merge **only once per move** (e.g., `[2,2,2,2]` becomes `[4,4,0,0]`). A new tile (2 or 4) spawns on a random empty cell only after a **successful move**. The game starts with 2 tiles and a score of 0.

- **Controls & Feedback:** Use the **arrow keys** to move all tiles. The `#reset` button immediately starts a fresh game. The interface provides clear visual feedback: the `#score` updates instantly, and new tiles have a subtle "pop" animation. A "Game Over" overlay appears when no moves are possible.

- **Layout & Styling:** The page features a centered **dark theme** with a glowing title. The `#board` is a 4x4 CSS grid where each cell's color and text size dynamically change based on its value (2, 4, 8, 16... up to 65536). Tiles have distinct, readable colors against the dark background.

- **Testing API:** The game exposes a `window.game` object with the required methods for automated grading. `setBoard(arr)` lets you inject a custom 4x4 grid for testing merge logic, `move('direction')` returns a boolean indicating success, and `board()` / `score()` return the current state.
